  "description": "Vintage Cowboy is a bold western-style display font featuring a rugged distressed texture inspired by classic cowboy signage and old saloon lettering. With its strong serif shapes and worn vintage details, this font is perfect for western-themed designs, retro posters, apparel, branding, logos, packaging, and rustic projects. It delivers an authentic Wild West atmosphere while remaining powerful and eye-catching for modern creative work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Vintage Cowboy is a bold western-style display font featuring a rugged distressed texture inspired by classic cowboy signage and old saloon lettering. With its strong serif shapes and worn vintage details, this font is perfect for western-themed designs, retro posters, apparel, branding, logos, packaging, and rustic projects. It delivers an authentic Wild West atmosphere while remaining powerful and eye-catching for modern creative work.</p>",
